## 🎓 Project Outcome

The Medical Operations Intelligence Dashboard & Decision Analysis System demonstrates how healthcare operational data can be organized, analyzed, and visualized to support hospital management. By combining structured datasets, database management, backend development, interactive charts, and predictive analytics, the project aims to improve operational visibility and enable more informed decisions about patients, staffing, resources, and financial performance.

